A forest path.~
   Looming mist covers the surroundings making it very hard to see.  Senses are
heightened here due to the faint sounds of birds and animals.  Dried leaves
smother the ground.  The sudden sound of twigs breaking gives the feeling of
something closing in.  As the path winds slowly between various unmarked
headstones, some look recent, others appear to be millennia old.  Others have
headstones with empty graves as if the corpse that was once in the grave has
been taken, or resurrected from the dead..  Way off into the distance, a
hideous tower looms out of the mist.  A black fog circles around the summit
thousands of feet above crackling with lightning.  The sound of thunder
reverberates all around.    
